            "title": "J&J lays out plan to splinter orthopedics business into separate company",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Johnson & Johnson is narrowing its focus again, nearly four years after peeling off its consumer health business.  The health care giant said Tuesday that it will separate its orthopedics business into a standalone company known as DePuy Synthes.  The move leaves J&J focused on its pharmaceutical and MedTech segments, which make prescription drugs, contact lenses and technology to treat cardiovascular disease and help with surgeries.",
